{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>You are able.</b> A noun-form, like עד יבושת המים (until the waters failed); it is not an expression of measurement as in the derash." "<b>And slaughtered them in the wilderness.</b> The meaning is 'and killed them,' and it says 'and slaughtered them' on account of the wilderness, for there the flocks graze."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:35.984921125Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}